  "_readme": [
    "Bob games allowlist for band 'little' (safety.md S2). A child-safety CONTENT filter, never a language rule.",
    "For 'little' players a word passes only if every token is here (plural and -ed/-ing forms of an entry pass",
    "too) AND it passes blocklist.json. Source: common early-childhood vocabulary drawn from the Dolch sight words",
    "(public domain, 1936/1948) and the Fry first-300 list, plus nouns, animals, foods, colours, numbers and silly",
    "words typical of picture books, selected by the Bob team.",
    "Status: a STARTER list (~700 words). safety.md S2 targets ~5k words; grow it toward that before the kids' launch.",
    "Review: every entry must be read by a human before merge; record the reviewer and date in 'review'.",
    "To extend: add lower-case base forms only (no plurals), keep one topic per line, never add anything that",
    "blocklist.json blocks (the test suite fails if you do), and run apps/api/tests/games-engine.test.ts."
  ],
